WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:38.210
Inherited Duel of Destiny

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:49.480
The two Gods' attack points are the same!

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.120
What?

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.940
Slifer...  Obelisk...

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.650
God vs God.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.220
A fight beyond their capabilities.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:04.140
Will they perish together?

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:12.340
Does this light mean Slifer and Obelisk's powers are repelling each other?

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.760
Incredible!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.760
I hope they don't blow up the tower.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:31.100
Yugi!

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.710
What's this?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.880
The Millennium Rod is glowing again.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.480
The Millennium Puzzle is...

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.180
What...

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.740
...is this?

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.120
Ancient...

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.490
...Egypt!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.200
No way!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:26.110
Two Gods.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.320
Everything is destroyed.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:35.550
Why did this happen?

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:58.950
The fog covered the town.  How gloomy.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.190
This pulse...

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.480
It's coming from that palace.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:42.890
The Great Dark Priest has conquered both heaven and earth with his evil power.

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:46.860
Both your authority and the Millennium Pyramid's power...

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.800
...are powerless against the dark power.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:54.770
It's only a matter of time until this land perishes.

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:01.000
That's the Millennium Puzzle!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.910
Why do you take their side?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.200
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:10.350
I won't submit to them.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.310
But I won't help you either.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:18.570
My Millennium Staff and my servants' power are your eternal enemies!

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:20.420
The Millennium Rod!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.910
So you want to end this here.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:27.550
You've realized that this fate is unavoidable.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.970
I will defeat you with my own hands!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:34.390
That is my greatest desire!

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:35.730
You...

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:42.280
Learn the power of my sacred servant that shakes the heavens!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:46.280
I'll destroy you and your servant until there's nothing left!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:50.970
Diaha!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.910
Come out, white dragon!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.060
That's Blue-Eyes!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:04.620
I summon the black magician who rests inside the weju!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.770
Dark Magician!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:18.650
Is this one of my lost memories?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.200
Unbelievable.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:24.590
But the monster that came out of the tablet was definitely Blue-Eyes!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.850
I see!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:41.100
That tablet shows the duelists who fought 3,000 years ago!

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:55.120
What?  What's going on?

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:04.000
The light is vanishing.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:05.930
Yugi!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.270
Big brother!

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:30.540
The Gods are gone.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:41.010
The Gods have disappeared.

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:46.600
The Millennium Rod meddled with their memories.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:49.610
What happened to them?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:00.820
What were those visions that flashed through my mind again?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.820
Impossible!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:08.210
The Pharaoh who confronted the priest was larger than life.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:13.370
He was overflowing with incredible fighting spirit and passion!

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:15.800
Yugi!

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:23.400
A Pharaoh accompanied by a black magician.

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.210
A priest controlling a white dragon.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:31.570
They were definitely us.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:38.360
The carvings on the tablet shows the battle 3,000 years ago.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:46.460
That is a piece of my lost memories!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:57.280
It's clear that Kaiba is in my lost memories!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:03.200
Yugi, you saw the same vision that I did?

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.820
Kaiba, I understand now.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:12.960
This fight is a duel of destiny that's lasted for 3,000 years!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.000
A duel of destiny that surpasses time!

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:45.860
Battle City is my fight to become a true duelist and regain my memories.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.500
With both Gods destroyed, the duel is back to square one.

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:05.580
Are their memories sealed inside the Millennium Rod and Yugi's Millennium Puzzle?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.510
If so, what did they see?

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:19.700
Kaiba, I'm now convinced that our battle will open the first door to my memories.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:25.740
When the Gods clashed, I don't know what trick they created.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.440
But I don't care about illusions from the past.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:31.800
I will defeat you!

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:36.620
And gain the title of Duel King and clear a path to my future!

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:39.640
I don't need a God for this fight anymore.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.580
Here I go, Yugi!

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:47.480
My God may be gone, but I haven't ended my turn yet.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:51.760
I set a card and end my turn.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:57.530
To defeat you, I need my servant who transcends God.  Blue-Eyes!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.260
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:03.050
This isn't the card I need.

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:07.020
I haven't drawn my key card yet.

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:11.240
Kaiba only has one set card in his field.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:14.770
But he won't let an attack get through easily.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.650
What will you do, Pharaoh?

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:23.950
I summon Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts in defense position this turn!

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:33.170
I now activate my trap!

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.000
Cloning!

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:39.910
Cloning?

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:46.040
This trap card summons a clone of your monster.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:49.700
Yugi, what will you do now?

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.960
I set another card!

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.740
I end my turn.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.220
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:59.160
You're being very careful.

00:13:00.740 --> 00:13:05.830
But by being too careful, your future is heading towards destruction.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:12.770
I will summon a new servant by tributing the clone next turn.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:18.400
Since his God is in the graveyard, the monster he'll summon is...

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:20.650
Can it be?  Blue-Eyes!

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:28.020
But he needs two tributes to summon a Level 8 monster.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:32.960
Even if he has that card in his hand, he can't summon it next turn.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:36.720
If I draw my key card before then...

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:39.170
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.770
Yugi, I'll tell you one thing.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:47.760
I already have Blue-Eyes in my hand.

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:53.880
You think I can't summon Blue-Eyes this turn.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:57.380
But this card will disprove that!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:01.150
From my hand, I activate the spell card, Cost Down!

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:09.060
For one turn, Cost Down lowers the Level of a monster in my hand by 2.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:15.100
I see!  Blue-Eyes drops from Level 8 to 6, so he can summon it with only one tribute!

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.000
Look, Yugi!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:21.310
This is no illusion!  It's the most powerful monster!

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:25.100
I tribute the clone.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.180
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:35.220
My brother's Blue-Eyes is here!

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:43.110
He summoned his Blue-Eyes?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.100
This duel is over.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:50.300
Yugi, your self-delusion has led to your defeat.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.600
Blue-Eyes attacks!

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:55.540
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:14:58.220 --> 00:14:59.910
Gazelle is destroyed!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:04.360
I end my turn.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.350
Bring it on, Yugi.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:11.660
But any monster with 3000 or fewer attack points will be destroyed!

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.170
My turn!

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:30.220
If that vision was real, the card I'm about to draw is determined by fate.

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:44.550
The card I draw will decide whether or not a new page will open in my memories!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.120
I draw!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.060
Kaiba, I know you saw it too.

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:55.770
The engravings on the 3,000 year-old tablet detailing the fight between two duelists!

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:01.370
It doesn't matter whether they're Pharaohs or priests!

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:05.810
The engravings depict the souls of fighters!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.930
And those souls have been passed down to us!

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:13.810
I'll prove that wasn't an illusion!

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.690
The spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:22.320
Awaken, the soul of the magician who sleeps in my graveyard!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.010
Magician?  Can it be?

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.740
Come out, Dark Magician!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:37.940
When Life Shaver forced Yugi to discard his hand, he sent Dark Magician to the graveyard.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:40.250
This situation is...

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:52.170
The same as then!

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:56.770
The tablet depicted a memory of my past battle.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:01.300
And if this duel is a piece of the puzzle to unlock my memories...

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:07.740
Kaiba!  I must defeat you to regain my lost memories!

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:13.480
But what happens starting now wasn't on the tablet or in our visions.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.380
Was there a result?

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:20.570
But even if that duel led to a certain destiny...

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.310
A vision of the result is an illusion.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:29.310
I decide my road of battle!  I decide my own destiny!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.200
My turn!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:34.800
I set a card!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:40.060
Blue-Eyes has 3000 attack points.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:45.420
Dark Magician has 2500 attack points.

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:49.980
Dark Magician alone can't defeat it.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:54.220
I have two set cards on my field.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:57.820
One is Magic Formula.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:02.510
It raises Dark Magician's attack points by 500.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:06.020
But that won't surpass Blue-Eyes's attack points.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.170
I'll wait for him to attack me.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:10.840
I end my turn!

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:13.440
Dark Magician...

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:17.310
You're obsessed with the vision we saw.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:20.780
But that vision is actually a lame illusion!

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:28.940
When you saw the tablet's Pharaoh and priest, your brain subconsciously created an image.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.790
The Pharaoh 3,000 years ago?

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.160
You make me laugh, Yugi.

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:43.700
You're a prisoner of a past destiny that you yourself created.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:44.870
What?

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:48.110
There's no hope seeking the past.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:53.330
Turn your back to the future!  Keep walking the road to the past towards defeat!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.230
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.840
I set a card!

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:01.170
Then I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.290
Card of Demise!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.280
In exchange for discarding my entire hand five turns from now...

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:09.930
...I can draw until I have five cards!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.100
A card that strengthens his hand!

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:14.670
His set cards...

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:20.050
One must be a spell card that raises Dark Magician's attack points.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:25.130
The other must be a trap that activates when Blue-Eyes attacks.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.550
Spellbinding Circle!

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:36.510
To prepare for the semifinals, I thoroughly studied your strategies during Battle City.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:40.680
I know what moves you'll make.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.990
Your deck is as transparent as a glass case!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:47.930
I summon this monster this turn!

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:49.230
What?

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:52.300
Come, Lord of D.!

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.610
Lord of D...

00:19:54.610 --> 00:20:01.550
As long as Lord of D. is on the field, my spells can't affect Blue-Eyes.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:06.600
I'll crush you next turn.

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:12.200
He knows my strategies.  What should I do?

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:14.360
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:18.300
I already know what you'll do, Yugi.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.230
I summon Beta The Magnet Warrior!

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.730
In defense position!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:30.340
He's going to attack Lord of D. with Dark Magician.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:34.530
Dark Magician attacks Lord of D.!

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:36.010
Black Magic!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.320
I caught you!

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.400
I activate my trap card!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.820
Magical Trick Mirror!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:50.830
Magical Trick Mirror lets me activate a spell card in your graveyard.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:56.270
I'll use this effect to activate a certain spell card in your graveyard!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.560
The card is...

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.140
Monster Reborn!

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:06.050
I'll use it to resurrect this monster!

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:11.020
Obelisk!

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.520
A God can only resurrect for one turn, and it can't attack.

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:16.950
But its effect...

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:21.740
...will completely protect my servant!

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:22.630
What?

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:29.370
Yugi, you can no longer stop your Black Magic Attack!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.170
No way!

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:35.360
It reflects the attack back, so you take damage!

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:42.440
Now I have more life points than you!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:02.470
The clash between Obelisk and Slifer showed Yugi and Kaiba's past.

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:07.710
Kaiba refuses to believe it, so he wants to destroy Yugi and the vision of the past.

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:11.850
Kaiba finally has three Blue-Eyes on his field!

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.270
Yugi is in trouble, when Jonouchi appears in his mind.

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:19.850
That's right, Yugi!  Don't forget your promise with Jonouchi!

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:23.720
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Promise with a Friend
Red-Eyes B. Dragon

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:25.200
Duel, standby!

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:40.160
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:48.530
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:59.690
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:09.190
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:18.240
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:19.020 --> 00:23:23.750
I'll live feeling them

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:28.940
For me to be me

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:37.390
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:38.070 --> 00:23:43.030
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:43.550 --> 00:23:52.690
We'll both understand that someday
